                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p><strong>本课程在解剖学知识传授的过程中提高学生学习医学知识的能力</strong><strong>:</strong></p>
<p><strong>1.</strong><strong>记忆</strong><strong>解剖学关键专业术语的概念，描述解剖学九大系统中各器官和结构中关键的形态学特点。</strong></p>
<p><strong>2.</strong><strong>运用</strong><strong>解剖学的理论与知识解决解剖学问题。</strong></p>
<p><strong>3.</strong><strong>揭示</strong><strong>并剖析日常生活中隐藏的解剖学知识点。</strong></p>
<p><strong>4. 推广普及健康中国2030。</strong></p></font></span><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
